# Git LFS — only the Blender source models under model/ are tracked in LFS.
# docs/assets/design2121.glb (the model the live site actually serves) must
# NOT be in LFS: GitHub Pages serves the deployment branch as plain files
# and does not resolve LFS pointers, so an LFS-tracked web GLB would ship
# as a pointer file and the live site could not load it. (Hark review #15-2.)
model/**/*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
